  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "BlueBlueSky is a large, classic coastal farmhouse located between the Gulf of Mexico and the Santa Rosa Golf and Beach Club golf course and is an easy, 6 min. walk or 2 min. bike ride to the beach, scenic 30A, bike trails, state parks, restaurants, and shopping. Beautifully renovated, this large family friendly/pet friendly 2 story home offers 4 bedrooms (2 master suites--one upstairs and one downstairs) and 4 1/2 bathrooms, providing each bedroom with a private bath. The wrap around front porch is perfect for enjoying the southern breeze and listening to the surf. Situated on almost a half acre, there is plenty of room for the kids to play in the oversized private pool (heating optional) or romp around the yard when not enjoying the white sandy beach and emerald water of the Gulf. The beach is a straight shot, south, down the street and is an easy walk or bike ride away. The golf course is a quick walk north. Private and peaceful, BlueBlueSky is a hidden Dune- Allen gem.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Private pool & yard, 2 mstr suites; 4 b/ 4.5 b; 6 min walk to beach, 30A, lake"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
